<p><strong>The Global Desk</strong> is an independent digital news platform headquartered in Dhaka, Bangladesh. We cover South Asia, Asia and global affairs, helping readers understand important developments through news, research and analysis.</p>

<h3>Our Mission</h3>
<p>Our mission is to make complex developments easier to understand by providing clear reporting, useful context and thoughtful perspectives. We aim to help readers look beyond headlines and understand why events matter.</p>

<h3>Our Coverage</h3>
<p>Our coverage includes international affairs, geopolitics, politics, economics, science, technology, environment and human rights, with attention to developments across South Asia, Asia and the wider world.</p>

<h3>Research</h3>
<p>Our Research section focuses on research-driven journalism, evidence-based analysis, insights and context to help readers explore important issues in greater depth.</p>

<h3>Z Desk</h3>
<p>Z Desk is a dedicated editorial space for Generation Z, featuring relevant news, ideas and explainers on issues shaping the lives and future of young people.</p>

<h3>Alpha Desk</h3>
<p>Alpha Desk is designed to introduce younger audiences to news and important topics through accessible, age-appropriate explanations and content.</p>

<h3>Our Values</h3>
<p>We value accuracy, clarity, independence, fairness and transparency. We aim to distinguish verified information from opinion and analysis, and to provide context that helps readers form their own understanding.</p>